corry (0.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * First Debian packages of Corry, the installer for Edukasaun OS and
    DebION GNU/Linux (based on Calamares 3.3.15).
  * corry replaces Debian's calamares and calamares-settings-debian and
    purges what is left of them.
  * corry-edukasaun and corry-debion make Corry the default installer.

